     fhir:url [ fhir:v "http://hl7.org/fhir/5.0/StructureDefinition/extension-Requirements.description"^^xsd:anyURI ] ;
     fhir:value [
       a fhir:markdown ;
       fhir:v "The [VHL Receiver](ActorDefinition-VHLReceiver.html) SHALL be capable of receiving a Verified Health Link (VHL) from a [VHL Holder](ActorDefinition-VHLHolder.html) through a supported transport mechanism (e.g., QR code scan, direct URL, or digital message).\n\nUpon receipt, the Receiver SHALL:\n* Parse the VHL\n* Validate its digital signature against a trusted key published by a recognized Trust Anchor\n* Prepare to retrieve the associated health documents\n\nReceipt of the VHL may occur through direct user interaction (e.g., scanning a QR code) or automated channels, depending on the implementation context."
     ]
